RD>\nSo nopé, nga def ay mébeut nguir at mi si topé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":423,"row":{"en":"Fishermen may go out to sea before the sun comes up.","wo":"Nappkat yi mën nañu dem géej balaa jant bi fenk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNapkat yi meun nagnou dem guedj bala djant bi feunk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":424,"row":{"en":"She meets a variety of interesting characters along the way, and she learns a lot about herself and the world around her.","wo":"Daje na ak nit ñu bari te wuute ci yoonam, ci la jàngee lu bari ci boppam ak àdduna bi ko wër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDadié na ak nitt gnou bari té wouté si yoonam, si la diangué lou bari si boppam ak addouna bi ko weur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":425,"row":{"en":"Originally published April 11, 2014 and updated periodically.","wo":"Ñu ngi ko njëkka siiwal 11 awril 2014 ba noppi di faral diko yeesal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnoungui ko ndieuka siwal 11 avril 2014 ba noppi di faral diko yessal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":426,"row":{"en":"* If your dog is nervous, try trimming their nails one at a time.","wo":"* Sudee sa xaj nanguwul, jéemal di dagg we yi benn-benn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou dé sa khadj nangouwoul, djémal di dagg wé yi bene bene.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":427,"row":{"en":"From the disappearance of Amelia Earhart to the identity of Jack the Ripper, these cases have left us wondering what really happened.","wo":"Li dalee ci réerug Amelia Earhart ba ci xam kan mooy Jack the Ripper, mbir yooyu nit ñi yàgg nañu bëgg a xam ni mbir yi deme.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLii dalé thi réroug amelia earhart ba thi kham kane moy jack the ripper mbir yoyou nitt gni yagg nagnou beug kham ni mbir yi démé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":428,"row":{"en":"The dog came closer and closer, its teeth bared.","wo":"Xaj da