The rooms are spacious and well-appointed, and the staff is friendly and helpful.","wo":"Néeg yi dañu yaatu te set, personel bi yaatu te laabiir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNégg yi daniou yaatou té set, personnel bi yaatou té laabiir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":458,"row":{"en":"The friends were terrified, but they were also curious.","wo":"Sama gaa yi tiit, waaye kumpa la woon ci ñoom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama gaayi tiite wayé koumpa la wone thi gnom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":459,"row":{"en":"Kevin: It would be, but I think the potential profits would be worth it.","wo":"Kevin: Mën na nekk, waaye li nga ci nara am ci xaalis jar nako.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKevin: Meun na nekk wayé li nga ci nara ame thi khaliss diar nako.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":460,"row":{"en":"Police have said that they are concerned for Green's safety and are asking anyone with information about her whereabouts to come forward.","wo":"Police neena xelal ñaaw na ci kaaraange Green ba noppi di sàkku ci képp kuko seen fenn nga jéem a jokkoo ak ñoom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\npolicé nena khélal niaw na si kaarangé green ba noppi di sakou si képp kouko séne féne gua djiém a diokho ak gnom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":461,"row":{"en":"They had heard stories about people getting scammed by online ads, and they didn't want to be one of them.","wo":"Yàgg na dégg ñu naan amna ñuy naxaate ci ay yëgle ci net bi, muni bëggul bokk ci ñi ñuy nax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYagg na deugg gnou nane amna gnoy nakhate si ay yeuglé si net bi, mouni beuggoul bok si gni gnoy nakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":462,"row":{"en":"If you swear a lot on your podcast, then it might not be worth the editing time to make it broadcast-compatible.","wo":"Soo waatee lu bari ci sa podcast kon daanaka du jar ñuy def temps bu bari ngir soppali wideo bi ci formaa wi war.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo waté lou bari thi sa podcast kone danaka dou diar niouy def temps bou bari nguir sopali vidéo bi thi formaa wi war.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":463,"row":{"en":"On weekends, I often sleep in late.","wo":"Ci njeexte ayu-bis yi damay faral di guddee tëdd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi ndiekhté ayou biss yi damay faral di goudé teuddé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":464,"row":{"en":"Person B: That's a great idea! I'm so excited to get started.","wo":"Nit B: Loolu xalaat bu rafet la! Yàkkamti naa nu tàmbali ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit B: Loolou khalaat bou rafet la! Yakhamti naa niou tambali ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":465,"row":{"en":"This has to do with fluid retention, although it may look like a pregnant belly!","wo":"Loolu moy di teye ndox, ndigam mënna nirook biiru jigen ju ëmb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou moy di teuye ndokh ndigam meuna nirokk biirou djiguéne djou eumb.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":466,"row":{"en":"If I compare with 1940, where it is specifically forbidden, I simply want to make sure I am not making a false assumption.","wo":"Suma koy méngale ak atum 1940 nga xam ni dañu ko ci doon tere, dama bëgga leerlu ni juumu ma ci limay xalaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSouma koy mengalé ak atoum 1940 nga khamni daniou ko thi done téré, dama beuga leerlou ni djoumouma si limay khalaat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":467,"row":{"en":"He didn't know what else to do.","wo":"Xamatul lumu wara def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamatul loumou wara def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":468,"row":{"en":"She was wearing a leather tunic and leggings, and she had a sword at her side I'mI'm okay, the soldier said You're hurt, the woman said Let me help you The woman helped the soldier to his feet.","wo":"Ndaw saa ngi sol tuniku der ak legging, te mingi roofoon benn sabre ci wetam, soldaar bi niko Maa ngi ci jàmm, ndaw si laaj ko Danga gaañu, Xaaral ma ndimbali la ndaw si jàppale ko mu jog taxaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdaw sa ngui sol tuniku der ak legging, te moungui roofone bene sabre si wetam, soldat bi niko Ma ngui si diam, ndaw si ladj ko Danga gagnou, kharal ma ndimbali la ndaw si diapalé ko mou diog takhaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":469,"row":{"en":"Given its drought-prone nature, Masvingo province is known as cattle-keeping country.","wo":"Ak naturam bu bari lumuy bekkoor, Masvingo province la ci réew mi, bu bari ay sàmmkat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAk naturam bou bari loumouy beukor, Masvingo province la si rew mi bou bari ay samkat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":470,"row":{"en":"But we didn't mind, because we were excited to see the fruits of our labor.","wo":"Waaye faale wunu ko ndax yàkkamtiwoon nanu gis meññeefu liñ liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé falé wouniouko ndakh yakamtiwone naniou guiss meugneufeul liniou ligueye.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":471,"row":{"en":"It can be used to process grief, anger, and other difficult emotions.","wo":"Mën nañu ko jëfandikoo ngir dàq naqar, mer wala génn ci tiis wu metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnouko dieufandiko nguir dak nakhar mer walla guenn thi tiiss wou metti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":472,"row":{"en":"However, despite these factors, there was never any regret or desire to quit.","wo":"Doonte loolu lépp xewna, musu ñu am luñuy réccu wala wane ni dañu bëgga bàyyi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoonté lolou lép hewna, mussou gnou ame lougnouy réthiou wala wané ni daniou beuga bayi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":473,"row":{"en":"Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes, or up to overnight.","wo":"Tëj ko nga dugal ko ci frigo bi 30 simili wala nga bàyyi ko ci mu fanaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTeudj ko nga dougal ko si frigo bi 30 simili wala nga bayi ko si mou fanaané.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":474,"row":{"en":"The man smiled. Very well, he said. Just step into this device and I'll start the process.","wo":"Ku góor ki daal di muuñ. Mu ni ko, kon baaxna duggal ci aparey, ma taal ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor kii daal di mougn. Mou niko kone bakhna douggal si aparey ma taal ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":475,"row":{"en":"Yes, it is, the man said.","wo":"Ku góor ki tontu ko, waawaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki tontou ko wawaw\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":476,"row":{"en":"Can't wait to hear about this amazing sight you and Steve experienced!","wo":"Mangi yakkamte degg ñuy wax ci espektakal bu yeeme bi yow ak Steve dindu!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMagui yakamti deugg gnuy wakh si espektakale bou yeume bi yaw ak steve dindou !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":477,"row":{"en":"Gate A in the northwest corner predominantly serves the festival bus station.","wo":"Gate A mooy barabu nord-est bi ñuy jaar ngir dem ci gaaraasu busu festiwaal bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGate A moy barabou nord-est bi gnuy diar nguir dem ci gaarassou bussou festival bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":478,"row":{"en":"Fill your info into the fields below.","wo":"Bindal say leeral ci barab yii ci suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBindal say léral thi barab yii thi souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":479,"row":{"en":"We picked the ripe tomatoes and peppers, and we carefully loaded them into the back of the truck.","wo":"Nu witt tomate ak kaani yu ñor yi, nu daal di leen yab ndànk ci keesu kamioŋ bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou witt tomate ak kaani you gnor yi, gnou daldi len yab ndank thi keussou camion bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":480,"row":{"en":"Others said that her paintings were too depressing and that they should not be shown in public.","wo":"Ñeneen ñi di wax ci moom ni ay tabloom day yokk nit naqar, te waru ñu ko fësal ba ñépp diko gis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnénéne gni di wakh thi mom ni ay tabloome day yok nitt nakhar té warou gnou ko feussal ba gneup diko guiss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":481,"row":{"en":"Drop by and say hello; stay strong and live awesome, my friend.","wo":"Jaaral te ne salam; dëgërlul te dundu lu neex, sama xarit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJaral té né salam deugeurloul té doundou lou nékh sama kharit\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":482,"row":{"en":"I took the portfolio back and started to walk away.","wo":"Ma jëlaat portfëy tàmbali dem sama yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dieulat portefeuil tàmbali dem sama yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":483,"row":{"en":"Dentist: It might be a little uncomfortable, but I'll do my best to make it as painless as possible.","wo":"Dàntist bi: Mën na xawa saf tuuti, waaye dinaa def luma mën ngir wàññi metit mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDantiste bi: Meun na khawa saf touti wayé dina def louma meun nguir wagnii metite mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":484,"row":{"en":"While this drug was initially used to treat pain, it soon became addictive and led to a rise in the number of drug addicts in the United States.","wo":"Bu njëkkoon dañu ko daan jëfandikoo ngir faj metit, waaye ñu dem bamu yàgg mu mujji nekk drog ci ñu bari ci Etats Unis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou ndieukone daniou ko dane dieufandiko nguir fadje metite wayé gnou dem bamou yague mou moudji neuk drogue thi gnou bari thi Etats Unis.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":485,"row":{"en":"Stanley Milgram's famous experiment highlights the powerful human tendency to obey authority.","wo":"Jàngat bu siiw bi Stanley Milgram amal, dafay wane ni nit ki dañu ko mooñaale nangu kiliftéef.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJangat bou siiw bi stanley milgram amal dafay wané ni nitt ki daniou ko moignalé nangou kiliftéff.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":486,"row":{"en":"I've been looking for a new place to buy backpacking gear A: Well, this is the place for you.","wo":"Maa ngi doon wër barab bu bees bu may mëna jëndee samay jumtukaayi ràndone A: Kon leegi am nga ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui done weur barab bou bess bou may meuna dieunde samay jumtoukayi randoné A: Kon légui am nga ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":487,"row":{"en":"spoon","wo":"ku yem ci boppam rekk","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nkou yeum si boppam rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":488,"row":{"en":"He was a poor man, and he and his mother often went hungry.","wo":"Seen famiy amul xaalis, yaayam dafa daan faral di xiif.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSeen famille amoul khaliss yayame dafa dane faral di hiff.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":489,"row":{"en":"Players must be able to skate, shoot, pass, and stickhandle at a high level.","wo":"Juër yi dañu wara mën skate, di dóor ci caax yi, paas ak mëna jëfandikoo bu baax yat wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJoueur yi daniou wara meune skate di door si thiax yi passe ak meuna dieufandiko bou bakh yat bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":490,"row":{"en":"Dentist: Let me take a look. [Examines the patient's teeth.] Hmm, it looks like you have a cavity.","wo":"Dàntist bi: Xaaral ma xool. [Mu xool bëñi malaad bi.] Hmm, daal melni sa bëñ bi daa bënn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDentiste bii: kharal ma khol. Mou khol beugn bi malaad bi. Hmmm, daal melni sa beugn bi da beunn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":491,"row":{"en":"Please register or log in to retrieve your license key and to download the latest version.","wo":"Nio gui lay nianane nga bindu wala nga duggu ngir jott sa thiaabi lisence té jott bi guena yeess.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnio gui lay niané nga bindou wala nga dougou nguir diott sa thiaabi licence té diott bi gueuna yéssé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":492,"row":{"en":"She was carrying a bouquet of flowers. Hello, she said. My name is Sarah.","wo":"Mu yor ci loxoom buke flër niko, Nanga def, man Sarah laa tudd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou yorr thi lokhoom bouké fleur niko nanga def mane sarah la toudé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":493,"row":{"en":"Salesperson: Great! I'm happy to help. We can also deliver and install the rug for you if you'd like.","wo":"Jaaykat bi: Waaw kay! Loo bëgg rek waxal. Soo bëggee nu indil la moket bi fi nga bëgg, mën nañu la ko lalal itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJaaykat bi: Waw kay! Loo beug rek wakhal. Soo beugué niou indil la moket bi fi nga beug, meun nagnou lako lalal itame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":494,"row":{"en":"I think of Ted's disintrest in outdoor activities and his bland cooking. I glance at Alfonso.","wo":"Ma xalaat ni Ted waxul dara ci génn, te bu toggee du neex, ma xoolaat Alfonso.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa khalat ni Ted wakhou dara thi guenn té bou togué dou nékh ma kholat Alfonso.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":495,"row":{"en":"For example, a child might use a doll to pretend to be a doctor, a teacher, or a firefighter.","wo":"Ci misaal, xale bi mën na jëfandikoo puppe ba noppi ni doktër la, jàngalekat, wala pompier.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi missal khalé bi meun na dieufandiko pupe ba nopi ni docteur la diangalékat wala pompier.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":496,"row":{"en":"These qualities have helped me to succeed in college and in my career.","wo":"Jikko yu baax yooyu ma jëlee universite, dimbali nañu ma ci sama liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiko you bakh yoyou ma dieulé université, dimbeuli nagnou ma thi sama liguey.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":497,"row":{"en":"A hospital can also include a number of support departments, such as medical records, pharmacy, laboratory, radiology, and rehabilitation.","wo":"Hopitaal bi mën na amaale yeneen bànxaasi yu koy jàppale, lu ci melni ñi yor done paj yi, farmasi, labo, radio, ak suqalikaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHopital bi meun na amalé yénéne bankhassi you koy diapalé, lou ci melni gni yor doné padj yi, pharmacie, labo, radio ak soukhalikaay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":498,"row":{"en":"Remove the press cloth and iron fabric to eliminate excess moisture.","wo":"Dindil mbusu pres te paase piis bi ngir dindi guus gu bëri gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDindil mboussou press té passé piiss bi nguir dindi gouss gou beuri gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":499,"row":{"en":"My research interests lie in the area of historical linguistics, and I have focused my work on the development of French from its origins in the Gallo-Romance dialects of the early Middle Ages.","wo":"Maa ngi jëmmale sama gëstu wàllu linguistic historique, ba noppi ma fësal sama liggéey ci yokkuteg français daale ko ci cosaanam ci dialect yu Gallo-Romance ci ndoorte Moyen Age.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui dieumale sama guestou wallou linguistique historique, ba noppi ma feussal sama liguey ci yokoutegue français dalé ko ci cosaaname ci dialect you Gallo-Romance ci ndorté Moyen Age.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}